(51, 'Golden Triangle Tour with Ranthambore 4N5D', 'golden-triangle-tour-with-ranthambore-4n5d', '<p>The <a href=\"https://indiadaytrip.com/tour/golden-triangle-tour-with-ranthambore-4n5d\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Golden Triangle Tour with Tiger Safari</a> is one of the premium India travel packages, covering Delhi, Agra and Jaipur along with an exciting Jungle wildlife tiger safari experience in Ranthambore National Park. This North India journey features visits to iconic sites like Taj Mahal, historic forts, royal palaces and an unforgettable tiger safari experience - making this itinerary perfect for travelers wanting culture, history and wildlife all in one trip. Enjoy comfortable transportation services, Heritage Accommodation Stay, guided sightseeing and an unforgettable India travel experience on this Golden Triangle Tour with Ranthambore 4N5D Journey!&nbsp;</p>', '[\"Private Golden Triangle tour with hotel stay & expert guide\",\"Visit Taj Mahal on a comfortable private tour with hotel stay\",\"Private safari at Ranthambore National Park with hotel included\",\"Explore Delhi, Agra & Jaipur on a private guided tour\",\"4N\\/5D private tour with hotels, transfers & daily breakfast\",\"Seamless private journey with hotel stay and local guides\"]', '[\"4 nights hotel Accommodation\",\"Daily breakfast at the hotel\",\"Private air-conditioned car with driver\",\"Private guided sightseeing tour in all cities\",\"Visit the famous Taj Mahal and other major attractions\",\"Ranthambore Jungle Safari Ticket\",\"Hotel pickup and drop-off in Delhi\",\"Daily Water Bottled\"]', '[\"5 % GST\",\"Monument entrance fees\",\"Lunch & dinner\",\"Personal expenses & tips\"]', '[{\"title\":\"Day 1 \\u2013 Delhi Arrival & Sightseeing\",\"points\":[\"Your India journey begins in the vibrant capital city of Delhi. After a warm welcome, start exploring historic and modern highlights including the grand Qutub Minar and the peaceful gardens of Humayun\'s Tomb. Drive past the iconic India Gate while learning about India\\u2019s history. Experience local culture, colorful streets, and architecture before checking into your hotel for a relaxing overnight stay.\"]},{\"title\":\"Day 2 \\u2013 Delhi to Agra Sightseeing\",\"points\":[\"After breakfast, travel comfortably to Agra, the city of timeless beauty. The highlight of the day is the magnificent Taj Mahal, where your guide shares fascinating stories behind its creation. Continue to the impressive Agra Fort, once home to Mughal emperors. In the evening, enjoy the relaxed atmosphere of Agra before heading to your hotel for an overnight stay.\"]},{\"title\":\"Day 3 \\u2013 Agra to Ranthambore\",\"points\":[\"Today the journey blends history and adventure. En route, explore the abandoned royal city of Fatehpur Sikri, famous for its red sandstone architecture. Continue driving towards Ranthambore, known for its forests and royal Bengal tigers. After arrival, check into your wildlife resort and enjoy the peaceful surroundings near the national park before preparing for the next day\\u2019s safari experience.\"]},{\"title\":\"Day 4 \\u2013 Ranthambore to Jaipur Sightseeing\",\"points\":[\"Start your morning with a thrilling Jungle Tiger safari inside Ranthambore National Park, where you may spot tigers, deer, and exotic birds and Animals in their natural habitat. After breakfast, continue the journey to Jaipur, the famous Pink City of India. On arrival, visit the beautiful fa\\u00e7ade of Hawa Mahal and explore lively markets before relaxing at your hotel overnight.\"]},{\"title\":\"Day 5 \\u2013 Jaipur Sightseeing & Delhi Drop\",\"points\":[\"After breakfast, discover Jaipur\\u2019s royal heritage with a visit to the majestic Amber Fort, located on a top with beautiful views. Continue exploring the elegant City Palace, a symbol of Rajasthan\\u2019s royal past. Later, drive back to Delhi with unforgettable memories of culture, architecture, and wildlife from your Golden Triangle with Ranthambore journey.\"]}]', 27999.00, '[\"tours-image\\/cropped_1766849852474_night-taj-mahal.webp\",\"data:image\\/webp;base64,\\/eNfs2f31c6\\/\\/jek7mP\\/CvV+pX9cew70OPOL5nj6t5LCCOXSA2l1I8kGRcBGTxxph3ZVBZ\\/TDuyqCz\\/qGQIIbKoLP6YcLUVF7ZYmHdoXDuyps22622VJHdlVf\\/Tp0UY0w6pnsqC8\\/7SdUM+k+JRpBYpS6eGGqCz+y0xx3mesHt2VQXec9RpnBdKf3s7TNAypnee0sMfxKEAORkOaYY81DdWeOP3YKTNMMeaY2YlCGuAoXfogG\\/1Y2nwrbAw1hHF\\/\\/PxgM+BAroyZqIISSujox6OZp8XkcynrLdrJBcPuTHV3WNhAl5l6F8Wj8p0\\/0lClKex582wgcd2Ckzw82BSXGbkAP\\/7D6RtlwgJpZ5DDmeCccMrSARsKjS4fJ7xwW69HPjD2t8b0zqb+JxdC4Cmm2Ck+ONiwLTmOmR4WVgpMxq3+XsbgrO4FamAOUaobu2NyhCgIL9gOTE5WqEgc9+BlFr45rEdYAlyccWllDrc2GGZOGJFMM2mfOTQrW8HqSmGfuXLMGiZo6r2X0g\\/DzhVjget2\\/LGluf8C0r1tsw8\\/OvdHalY7Ht9vmEB12R+qDkik6s8V484HIpMeOx6mRCaDlSZ6GBFfO5rZjAfwlmY58afm\\/0RPVT4VH+858u4RbBY2Vebkg8jlplVoNljVw19WsV\\/5468kcynVtSp034jo7YyxmF0jSU6ix1eKhipJ3Yb6O+eJPZI1qaSEYQdQxuyk9E7kDO\\/QwaFDezFpyPOhU1QtMvu8CfnrCxKWR6fTNtXooibuzsJHmY\\/La\\/MCk7sy07npNwPTZdYyV1FBlmfA4E\\/efSbzQdPrJtvp7YKQT7jPo6QMUOAI\\/yxmmc0dxUyG5FiisCuyio2vyuYshTHJxM\\/LGqEZIZsqbNpbvOszYlShbzeIOd3VBy+rfUa7+Ka8F8kD\\/BVB9RbGBfy1ALWnDQ8ol38RFrUOxolG2lJCGqOMyNggoWdeL0Arn4sl6gLPEWc3iDqjLHXVZWLkSajdG35A1pNs\\/42TyXh11jNr+7rFAdHCx4U5BXa+55MDzWLqIXKPRrvb7KENPE+ky7sbZ5yYv9Rzd+6IndFEaZRGj1QsFaW7U0pNzseNONOwV3R4Ytfe0MlKl8M2okCRkphfXmQ4MP9DDrRU034P5EEd2F9motrj30Uap\\/DfZVvutIsMTiksrySKlngbjTCXqBdh8FfZlCLKwctk+Aw\\/3YRUgyt6EIGrefTUMoVDSnIe\\/3gqhldXZL2ufIIkQRlm8lErshd+XzFdYMdjymCB5x7pSF8Yzn5BKv4qrryhdvY28aaNaD2M6UdtvjhyAo5Z5Je3tm\\/rkEwgxB\\/Z1TlsmQpWEHSnTM8HUoL4oagQYxWlqKBca+lQhXU01ThYbdhLo1B9bE8fLI2OHnLW9oruXsBHblSFjiCWYaXYb+jUzZzO3bwM5jcPV9KYxGgkxD0mmYA+bLCC+V5zYzbralIDurbC4vFarwTQxlpPjDe6nRtkehXWi57Dju+6IHjhhkqTQMDkyESpwtXy6LAuiJDgNRR9zrR0jm5SUDI5CeaB\\/Naw16z\\/9XN3vmi37Ir\\/kW3LR1TaPMbW6OkVc1Bk1h4LcZgzFA6GU8pMXritbin1blyhCwkQ6KXRT\\/yGaotz2s14of+7vq3L+od401Czc84EFkkIwgYguiaUp0z\\/BkWGd0yVQ2CGAFn8NmLiQbQlCl8qzWnUswPG0yEgg+5oiigP4SR1JK2iuNt\\/mRJKEThVGMILWKzbmelQ9d9NSUMoWxAlGYm8DfJ7+F9H6djbQi\\/TR6o4Zo3DvSwSL