d Jaipur.\"},{\"question\":\"4. What is the best time to visit Ranthambore for tiger safari?\",\"answer\":\"The best time to visit Ranthambore National Park is from October to June. Summer months\\n(March to June) offer higher chances of tiger sightings near water bodies.\"},{\"question\":\"5. How many days are ideal for this Golden Triangle with Ranthambore tour?\",\"answer\":\"A 6 to 8-day itinerary is ideal to comfortably explore Delhi, Agra, Jaipur, and enjoy wildlife\\nsafaris in Ranthambore without rushing.\"}]', 1, ''),
(52, 'golden triangle toui 3n4d', 'golden-triangle-toui-3n4d', '<p>The <a href=\"https://indiadaytrip.com/tour/golden-triangle-toui-3n4d\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Golden Triangle Tour 3N4D</strong></a> is one of the most popular India travel itineraries covering Delhi, Agra, and Jaipur. This classic North India tour lets travelers explore historic monuments, vibrant markets, and royal heritage sites including the world-famous <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Taj_Mahal\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Taj Mahal</a>. Perfect for first-time visitors to India, the tour combines culture, architecture, and local experiences in a short trip. With comfortable and private transportation, sightseeing accompanied by professional guides, and well-planned itineraries, this 4-day Delhi, Agra, Jaipur tour package offers you the experience of a memorable journey to India\'s most famous destinations.</p>', '[\"Private Golden Triangle tour with hotel stay & expert guides\",\"Visit Taj Mahal at sunrise \\u2013 India\\u2019s most iconic monument\",\"3 nights comfortable hotel stay with daily breakfast\",\"Explore Delhi, Agra & Jaipur with private AC car & driver\",\"Skip the stress with pre-planned sightseeing & transfers\",\"Discover forts, palaces & UNESCO sites with local experts\"]', '[\"3 Nights hotel accommodation\",\"Daily breakfast at the hotel\",\"Private AC car with professional driver\",\"Expert local tour guides in Delhi, Agra and Jaipur\",\"All sightseeing as per the tour itinerary\",\"Pick-up and drop-off from Delhi hotel \\/ airport\",\"All toll taxes, parking, fuel and driver allowance\",\"Complimentary Daily bottled water\"]', '[\"5% GST\",\"Monument entrance fees\",\"Lunch, dinner\",\"Any personal expenses\",\"shopping or tips\"]', '[{\"title\":\"Day 1: Delhi Arrival & Sightseeing\",\"points\":[\"Arrive at Delhi where our driver will welcome and embark on your private city tour of iconic attractions like Red Fort, Jama Masjid, Raj Ghat India Gate Parliament House Humayun\'s Tomb and Qutub Minar while learning their history from your guide. In the evening check into your hotel and relax before enjoying an overnight stay!\"]},{\"title\":\"Day 2 : Delhi to Agra Sightseeing\",\"points\":[\"Following breakfast, drive from Delhi to Agra by private AC car and meet your guide upon arriving. Discover Agra Fort, which has been classified a UNESCO World Heritage Site; then see Itmad-ud-Daulah or Baby Taj and Mehtab Bagh for views of Taj Mahal at sunset before checking into a hotel and staying overnight in Agra.\"]},{\"title\":\"Day 3 : Taj Mahal Sunrise - Fatehpur Sikri - Jaipur\",\"points\":[\"Visit the iconic symbol of love that is the Taj Mahal at sunrise for an exclusive guided tour and then return back to your hotel for breakfast and check-out. As part of your drive towards Jaipur en route Fatehpur Sikri was visited which served as former Mughal capital before moving forward towards Jaipur known as Pink City where your hotel awaits and you may unwind overnight in peace and serenity.\"]},{\"title\":\"Day 4 : Jaipur Sightseeing - Delhi Drop\",\"points\":[\"After breakfast, begin your Jaipur sightseeing tour - visiting Amber Fort, City Palace and Hawa Mahal as well as local markets and learning more about Jaipur\'s royal history from your guide. Later drive back to Delhi via private car; once arriving back at your hotel or airport you will mark the end of this tour.\"]}]', 17999.00, '[\"1777466023_69f1faa7c7834.webp\",\"1777466154_69f1fb2a6203e.webp\",\"1777466185_69f1fb494514e.webp\",\"1777535335_69f309675d103.webp\",\"1777535344_69f3097008cc6.webp\",\"1777535357_69f3097ddd5ef.webp\",\"1777535360_69f30980dab66.webp\",\"1777535380_69f309949c5be.webp\",\"1777535384_69f30998a65c9.webp\"]', NULL, 20, 3, 'Delhi – Agra – Jaipur', '4 Days', 5.00, 39, '2026-01-07 17:59:38', '2026-04-30 07:49:51', 'Golden Triangle Tour 3N4D | 4 Days Delhi Agra Jaipur Tour', 'Discover Delhi, Agra & Jaipur on a 3N/4D Golden Triangle Tour. Visit Taj Mahal, Amber Fort & top sights with private car, guide & hotel stay. Book now!', '', NULL, 'INDEX,FOLLOW', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"question\":\"1. What is included in the Golden Triangle Tour 3N\\/4D package?\",\"answer\":\"The tour typically includes private AC car, hotel accommodation, daily breakfast,\\nprofessional guide, toll taxes, and sightseeing in Delhi, Agra, and Jaipur.\"},{\"question\":\"2. Is 4 days enough for Delhi Agra Jaipur tour?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, 4 days is ideal to explore major attractions like Taj Mahal, Amber Fort, and key\\nhighlights of Delhi comfortably.\"},{\"question\":\"3. What is the best time to book Golden Triangle Tour?\",\"answer\":\"The best time is from October to March when the weather is pleasant, making sightseeing in\\nDelhi, Agra, and Jaipur more enjoyable.\"},{\"question\":\"4. Can I customize the Golden Triangle Tour itinerary?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, the tour is fully customizable. You can add destinations like Pushkar or Varanasi based\\non your travel preferences.\"},{\"question\":\"5. Is the Golden Triangle Tour suitable for first-time visitors to India?\",\"answer\":\"Absolutely! This is the most popular route for first-time travelers, covering India\'s rich\\nculture, history, and iconic landmarks like the Taj Mahal.\"}]', 1, '');
