(53, 'Royal Rajasthan Tour 5N6D', 'royal-rajasthan-tour-5n6d', '<p>Choose the <a href=\"https://indiadaytrip.com/tour/royal-rajasthan-tour-5n6d\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Royal Rajasthan Tour 5N/6D</strong></a> package to see Jaipur, Jodhpur, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Udaipur\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Udaipur</a>, and Pushkar. This well-planned Rajasthan itinerary will take you to grand forts, royal palaces, colourful markets, and beautiful lakes. Take an unforgettable trip that includes history, culture, and luxury. This tour is great for couples, families, and people who are going on vacation for the first time. It includes private transfers, guided tours, and comfortable places to stay. Book now to get the most out of your trip to Rajasthan.</p>', '[\"Explore royal forts & palaces in Jaipur with expert guide\",\"Discover Blue City charm of Jodhpur heritage sites & markets\",\"Enjoy romantic lakes & palaces in Udaipur sightseeing tour\",\"Explore Brahma Temple & sacred ghats in Pushkar\",\"Stay in heritage hotels with daily breakfast in Hotel\",\"Private AC car, driver & guided tours for hassle-free trip\"]', '[\"luxury hotel stay in Jaipur, Jodhpur, Udaipur & Pushkar\",\"Daily buffet breakfast at hotels\",\"Private luxury AC car & Sightseeing\",\"Professional chauffeur with uniform & experience\",\"Expert local tour guides for each city tour\",\"Personalized sightseeing & flexible itinerary\",\"All tolls, parking, fuel & driver allowances included\",\"Complimentary bottled water during travel\",\"24\\/7 on-trip assistance for a seamless experience\"]', '[\"5 % GST\",\"Monument entrance\",\"Lunch & Dinner\",\"tips\"]', '[{\"title\":\"Day 1: Arrival in Jaipur & Sightseeing\",\"points\":[\"Arrive in Jaipur, the Pink City, and begin your Royal Rajasthan Tour with a warm welcome. Explore top attractions like Amber Fort, City Palace, Hawa Mahal, and local bazaars. Enjoy a guided sightseeing experience with a private car and driver. This Jaipur city tour offers a perfect introduction to Rajasthan\\u2019s royal heritage, vibrant culture, and architectural beauty. Overnight stay in a comfortable hotel in Jaipur.\"]},{\"title\":\"Day 2: Jaipur to Pushkar\",\"points\":[\"After breakfast, drive to Pushkar, one of the most sacred towns in Rajasthan. Visit the most famous Brahma Temple and take an evening peaceful walk around Pushkar Lake. Explore local markets and experience the spiritual charm of this holy destination. This Jaipur to Pushkar journey offers a blend of culture, devotion, and scenic beauty. Check-in at the hotel and relax. Overnight stay in Pushkar.\"]},{\"title\":\"Day 3: Pushkar to Jodhpur\",\"points\":[\"Today, you go to Jodhpur, known as the Blue City of Rajasthan. Upon arrival, explore local streets and vibrant markets. Enjoy the cultural atmosphere and traditional lifestyle of this historic city. This Pushkar to Jodhpur route showcases Rajasthan\\u2019s desert beauty and authentic experiences. Check into your hotel and unwind after the journey. Overnight stay in Jodhpur.\"]},{\"title\":\"Day 4: Jodhpur Local Sightseeing\",\"points\":[\"Discover the best of Jodhpur with a full-day city tour. Visit Mehrangarh Fort, Jaswant Thada, and Umaid Bhawan Palace. Enjoy panoramic views of the blue houses and explore local markets for handicrafts. This Jodhpur sightseeing tour highlights royal history, architecture, and culture. Travel comfortably with your private guide and vehicle. Return to hotel for a relaxing overnight stay in Jodhpur.\"]},{\"title\":\"Day 5: Jodhpur to Udaipur\",\"points\":[\"After breakfast check out your hotel, drive to Udaipur, the knows as \' City of Lakes \'. Upon arrival, check in your hotel and take some time to relax. In the evening, explore nearby areas or enjoy a peaceful walk by the lake. This Jodhpur to Udaipur transfer offers a refreshing change with natural beauty and romantic vibes. Overnight stay in Udaipur.\"]},{\"title\":\"Day 6: Udaipur Sightseeing & Drop\",\"points\":[\"On the final day, explore Udaipur\\u2019s top attractions including City Palace, Lake Pichola, and Jagdish Temple. Enjoy a boat ride (optional) and admire the scenic beauty of Rajasthan\\u2019s most romantic city. This Udaipur sightseeing tour completes your Royal Rajasthan journey with unforgettable memories. Later, you will be dropped at your preferred location for onward travel.\"]}]', 24999.00, '[\"tours-image\\/cropped_1767810723721_cropped_1766849852474_night-taj-mahal.webp\",\"tours-image\\/cropped_1766858356515_delhi-food-taste.webp\",\"tours-image\\/cropped_1766858392129_night-delhi.webp\",\"tours-image\\/cropped_1767538358273_agra-tour-1.webp\",\"tours-image\\/cropped_1767538419287_udaipur-tour.webp\"]', NULL, 20, 14, 'Rajasthan', '6 Days', 5.00, 17, '2026-01-07 18:02:14', '2026-04-28 08:31:40', 'Royal Rajasthan Tour 5N/6D | Jaipur, Jodhpur, Udaipur & Push', 'Live the royal Rajasthan experience—explore Jaipur, Jodhpur, Udaipur & Pushkar with grand palaces, majestic forts & rich heritage on a luxurious 5N/6D journey.', '', NULL, 'INDEX,FOLLOW', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"question\":\"1. What destinations are covered in the Royal Rajasthan Tour 5N\\/6D?\",\"answer\":\"This tour typically includes iconic cities like Jaipur, Jodhpur, and Udaipur, offering a perfect\\nblend of royal palaces, forts, and cultural heritage\"},{\"question\":\"2. What is included in the Royal Rajasthan Tour package?\",\"answer\":\"The package usually includes hotel accommodation, daily breakfast, private air-conditioned\\ntransport, sightseeing tours, and a professional guide for major attractions.\"},{\"question\":\"3. What is the best time to book a Rajasthan tour?\",\"answer\":\"The best time to visit Rajasthan is from October to March when the weather is pleasant,\\nmaking it ideal for sightseeing and desert experiences.\"},{\"question\":\"4. Is the Royal Rajasthan Tour suitable for families and couples?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, this tour is perfect for families, couples, and even solo travelers. It offers a mix of\\nheritage, culture, shopping, and relaxation experiences.\"},{\"question\":\"5. How can I customize the Royal Rajasthan Tour 5N\\/6D?\",\"answer\":\"India Day Trip offers flexible customization options. You can modify hotels, add destinations\\nlike Pushkar or Jaisalmer, and adjust the itinerary as per your travel preferences.\"}]', 1, ''),
(54, 'Old Delhi Food Tasting Tour Evening 4 Hours', 'old-delhi-food-tasting-tour-evening-4-hours', '<p>The <a href=\"https://indiadaytrip.com/tour/old-delhi-food-tasting-tour-evening-4-hours\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Old Delhi Food Tasting Tour</strong></a> is a guided evening experience that introduces travelers to the rich culinary heritage of Delhi. Over four hours, explore narrow lanes, historic markets, and iconic food spots known for traditional recipes. The tour offers insight into local culture, history, and flavors through curated tastings. Ideal for food lovers and cultural explorers, this experience focuses on authenticity and safety. Guided by local experts, travelers enjoy a flavorful journey through <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chandni_Chowk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Old Delhi</a> vibrant street food scene while learning about the area’s heritage.</p>', '[\"Guided food tasting experience\"]', '[\"Local food tastings\"]', '[\"Personal purchases\"]', '[{\"title\":\"Day 1\",\"points\":[\"Evening meeting point\"]}]', 2499.00, '[\"cropped_1767810745560_cropped_1766848989644_udaipur-tour.webp\",\"cropped_1766849235504_amritsar-tour.webp\",\"cropped_1766859130236_gatiman.webp\",\"cropped_1767538358273_agra-tour-1.webp\",\"1777464365_69f1f42dc4f14.webp\"]', NULL, 20, 1, 'Old Delhi', '4 Hours', 5.00, 49, '2026-01-07 18:03:52', '2026-04-29 20:30:53', 'Evening Delhi City Tour 4 Hours with Pickup & Drop & Guide', 'Enjoy a 4-hour evening Delhi tour with street food tasting. Visit India Gate & Connaught Place with pickup, drop & guide. Taste local flavors—book now!', '', NULL, 'INDEX,FOLLOW', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[]', 1, ''),
(55, 'Colorful Rajasthan Tour 8D9N', 'colorful-rajasthan-tour-8d9n', '<p>Discover the best of Rajasthan with this <a href=\"https://indiadaytrip.com/tour/colorful-rajasthan-tour-8d9n\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Colourful Rajasthan Tour 8D9N</strong></a> covering top destinations like Jaipur, Mandawa, Bikaner, Jodhpur, Jaisalmer, and Udaipur. This Rajasthan tour package includes forts, palaces, desert safari in Jaisalmer, camel ride, and cultural experiences. Explore the Blue City Jodhpur and lakes of Udaipur. Ideal for travelers looking for a complete <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rajasthan\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Rajasthan</a> itinerary with heritage, culture, and desert adventure in India.&nbsp;</p>', '[\"Stay in 8 Nights luxury hotels with Daily breakfast\",\"Travel in private chauffeur car for a smooth premium ride\",\"Explore royal palaces in Jaipur, Udaipur & Jodhpur in style\",\"Experience golden desert safari & camel ride in Jaisalmer\",\"Enjoy handpicked heritage stays with royal Rajasthani charm\",\"Personalized VIP service with hassle-free luxury transfers\"]', '[\"Luxury hotel accommodation with daily breakfast\",\"Private air-conditioned car with professional chauffeur\",\"Pickup & drop with seamless door-to-door transfers\",\"Expert local tour guides for a personalized experience\",\"Desert safari & camel ride in Jaisalmer\",\"All sightseeing as per itinerary with full comfort\",\"Bottled water & travel assistance throughout the tour\",\"All toll taxes, parking, fuel & driver allowances included\"]', '[]', '[{\"title\":\"Day 1: Jaipur to Pushkar \\u2013 Spiritual Start of Rajasthan Tour\",\"points\":[\"Begin your tour in Jaipur and then drive to the sacred city of Pushkar. Visit the sacred Brahma Temple and Pushkar Lake, which is noted for its peaceful ghats. Enjoy the busy neighbourhood markets and the aarti in the evening. This day is a great way to start your Rajasthan tour package, which is a combination of culture and spirituality. Spend the night at Pushkar.\"]},{\"title\":\"Day 2: Pushkar to Udaipur \\u2013 Journey to the City of Lakes\",\"points\":[\"After breakfast, go to Udaipur, which is frequently named the \\\"Venice of the East.\\\" Enjoy the wonderful vistas of the countryside as you drive. When you reach there, you can rest at your hotel or take a peaceful walk around Lake Pichola. This phase of your vacation to Rajasthan is a great blend of nature and imperial beauty. Spend the night in Udaipur.\"]},{\"title\":\"Day 3: Udaipur Local Sightseeing \\u2013 Royal Heritage & Lakes\",\"points\":[\"You can witness how gorgeous Udaipur is at City Palace, Jagdish Temple, and Saheliyon Ki Bari. Take a boat ride on Lake Pichola and watch the sunset from the water. This day proves that Udaipur is a must-see place in Rajasthan. It has the right amount of history, romance, and natural beauty. Spend the night in Udaipur.\"]},{\"title\":\"Day 4: Udaipur to Jodhpur \\u2013 Into the Blue City\",\"points\":[\"Drive to Jodhpur, where the buildings are blue. Enjoy the changing landscape of Rajasthan along the journey. You can relax or shop at the local markets when you arrive there. This excursion adds to your Rajasthan trip by letting you see the desert\'s unique culture. For one night, stay in Jodhpur.\"]},{\"title\":\"Day 5: Jodhpur Sightseeing \\u2013 Forts & Royal Legacy\",\"points\":[\"Today you visit Mehrangarh Fort, Jaswant Thada, and the Umaid Bhawan Palace. Take a stroll around the ancient city\'s blue streets and look at the vivid markets. If you\'re going to Rajasthan, you should definitely go to Jodhpur. It has a lot of history and gorgeous buildings. Spend the night in Jodhpur.\"]},{\"title\":\"Day 6: Jodhpur to Jaisalmer \\u2013 Into the Golden Desert\",\"points\":[\"Go to Jaisalmer, the Golden City of Rajasthan. As you go, take in the sights of the desert. When you get there, take some time to rest and get ready for the adventure in the desert. This day marks the end of the royal cities and the beginning of the mystical Thar Desert. Spend the night at Jaisalmer.\"]},{\"title\":\"Day 7: Jaisalmer Sightseeing & Desert Safari Experience\",\"points\":[\"Go to the Patwon Ki Haveli, Jaisalmer Fort, and the local marketplaces. After that, head to Sam Sand Dunes for a camel ride, a desert safari you\'ll never forget, and a cultural evening with traditional music and dance. This is one of the most fun things you\'ll do in Rajasthan. Spend the night in a desert tent or a motel.\"]},{\"title\":\"Day 8: Jaisalmer to Bikaner \\u2013 Desert to Heritage Route\",\"points\":[\"Take your car and drive to Bikaner. Visit the old city and Junagarh Fort when you reach there. Bikaner has a lengthy history and desert traditions that make it a distinct cultural stop on your vacation to Rajasthan. Spend the night at Bikaner.\"]},{\"title\":\"Day 9: Bikaner \\u2013 Mandawa \\u2013 Jaipur Drop\",\"points\":[\"Travel through Mandawa, which is known for its havelis with stunning paintings and frescoes. Before you go to Jaipur for your last drop-off, do a quick tour. Your journey to Rajasthan will leave you with memories of regal history, desert experiences, and a culture that is full of life that will last a lifetime.\"]}]', 0.03, '[\"tours-image\\/cropped_1767810768802_cropped_1766849432245_amritsar-tour.webp\",\"tours-image\\/cropped_1766850086738_night-taj-mahal.webp\",\"tours-image\\/cropped_1766858356515_delhi-food-taste.webp\",\"tours-image\\/cropped_1767538419287_udaipur-tour.webp\",\"tours-image\\/cropped_1767538451873_varanashi-tour.webp\"]', NULL, 20, 14, 'Rajasthan', '', 5.00, 21, '2026-01-07 18:04:40', '2026-04-28 08:30:46', 'Colourful Rajasthan Tour 8D/9N | Jaipur, Udaipur, Jodhpur', 'Live the colours of Rajasthan—walk through royal forts, admire palaces & ride across desert dunes. Culture, heritage & adventure in one Colourful Rajasthan 8D/9', '', NULL, 'INDEX,FOLLOW', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"question\":\"1. What destinations are covered in the Colourful Rajasthan Tour 8D\\/9N?\",\"answer\":\"This tour covers top Rajasthan cities like Jaipur, Udaipur, Jodhpur, and Jaisalmer,\\noffering a perfect mix of royal palaces, desert landscapes, and cultural heritage.\"},{\"question\":\"2. What is included in the Rajasthan 8D\\/9N tour package?\",\"answer\":\"The package typically includes hotel accommodation, daily breakfast, private transportation,\\nsightseeing, and guided tours of major attractions like Amber Fort and City Palace.\"},{\"question\":\"3. Is desert safari included in the Jaisalmer tour?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, the tour includes an exciting desert safari in Thar Desert, featuring camel rides, sunset\\nviews, and cultural performances at a desert camp in Jaisalmer.\"},{\"question\":\"4. What is the best time to book the Rajasthan tour?\",\"answer\":\"The best time to visit Rajasthan is from October to March when the weather is pleasant,\\nmaking sightseeing and desert activities more enjoyable across cities like Jaipur and\\nJaisalmer\"},{\"question\":\"5. Is this Rajasthan tour suitable for families and couples?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, the Colourful Rajasthan Tour is perfect for families, couples, and solo travelers. It offers\\na blend of cultural experiences, heritage sites, and relaxing stays in royal-style hotels.\"}]', 1, ''),
(56, 'Rajasthan Heritage Tour 4N5D', 'rajasthan-heritage-tour-4n5d', '<p>Check out the best <a href=\"https://indiadaytrip.com/tour/rajasthan-heritage-tour-4n5d\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Rajasthan Heritage Tour 4N5D</strong></a><strong> </strong>package and see what it was like to live like a royal in Rajasthan. This Rajasthan tour package includes the most famous cities, such as Jaipur, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jodhpur\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Jodhpur</a>, and Udaipur, which are known for their f<strong>﻿</strong>orts, palaces, and historical sites. Enjoy a guided tour, a hotel stay, and easy transportation. This 4-night, 5-day trip to Rajasthan is great for couples, families, and people who are going there for the first time. Book the Rajasthan Heritage Tour 4N5D at the best price and see historical sites, local markets, and real Indian culture for an unforgettable trip to India.&nbsp;</p>', '[\"Explore Jaipur, Jodhpur & Udaipur with private chauffeur service\",\"Stay in handpicked heritage hotels with premium comfort\",\"Expert local guided tour of iconic forts, Markets & landmarks\",\"Travel in AC vehicle with door-to-door service included\",\"Experience local culture, markets & authentic cuisine\",\"Flexible itinerary with personalized travel assistance\"]', '[\"4 Nights hotel stay in Jaipur, Jodhpur & Udaipur\",\"Daily breakfast at hotel\",\"Private air-conditioned car with professional driver\",\"Professional local expert guide in each city\",\"Pickup & drop from airport\\/railway station\",\"Sightseeing as per itinerary (private tour)\",\"All toll tax, parking, fuel & driver allowance\",\"Personalized travel assistance throughout the tour\"]', '[\"5 % GST\",\"Monuments Entrance fees\",\"Lunch & Dinner\",\"Tips\"]', '[{\"title\":\"Day 1: Jaipur to Jodhpur (Blue City Journey)\",\"points\":[\"Start your 4N5D Rajasthan Heritage Tour in Jaipur and drive to Jodhpur, which is also called the Blue City. Take a beautiful road trip through the countryside of Rajasthan. Check into your hotel and relax when you get there. In the evening, check out the local markets or take a short walk around the old city. This day is the perfect way to start your Rajasthan tour package with culture and comfort.\"]},{\"title\":\"Day 2: Jodhpur Sightseeing Tour\",\"points\":[\"Take a guided tour of Jodhpur to learn about its rich history. Go to the grand Mehrangarh Fort, Jaswant Thada, and check out the lively local markets. Learn about royal history, see beautiful architecture, and get a great view of the city. This day is perfect for travelers who want to experience Rajasthan\'s real heritage through culture, history, and unforgettable moments.\"]},{\"title\":\"Day 3: Jodhpur to Udaipur via Scenic Route\",\"points\":[\"After breakfast, drive to Udaipur, the City of Lakes, from Jodhpur. Enjoy views of the countryside and optional stops at temples or villages along the way. Arrive in Udiapur, check in your hotel and relax. You can spend the evening however you want, or you can take a peaceful walk by the lake. This trip adds charm to your Rajasthan itinerary by taking you to beautiful places and letting you meet people from different cultures.\"]},{\"title\":\"Day 4: Udaipur Sightseeing Tour\",\"points\":[\"Take a full-day tour of Udaipur, a romantic city. Check out the beautiful City Palace, the peaceful Lake Pichola, and other nearby attractions. Enjoy beautiful buildings, views of the lake, and the culture of the area. A boat ride at night is an optional extra that makes it even more magical. This day shows off the beauty of Rajasthan\'s royal history.\"]},{\"title\":\"Day 5: Udaipur to Jaipur Drop\",\"points\":[\"After breakfast, drive back to Jaipur from Udaipur with memories that will last a lifetime from your 4N5D Rajasthan Heritage Tour. Have a pleasant trip with beautiful views along the way. When you get there, you\'ll be dropped off at the place you want to go. This is the end of your Rajasthan tour package, which was full of royal, historical, and cultural experiences.\"]}]', 22999.00, '[\"tours-image\\/cropped_1767810701055_cropped_1767538320858_sunrise-taj-2.webp\",\"tours-image\\/cropped_1767538358273_agra-tour-1.webp\",\"tours-image\\/cropped_1767538419287_udaipur-tour.webp\",\"tours-image\\/cropped_1767538451873_varanashi-tour.webp\",\"tours-image\\/cropped_1767538716104_delhi-food-taste.webp\"]', NULL, 20, 14, 'Rajasthan', '5 Days', 5.00, 35, '2026-01-07 18:07:01', '2026-04-28 08:30:18', 'Rajasthan Heritage Tour 4N/5D | Jaipur, Udaipur & Jodhpur T', 'Step into royal Rajasthan—explore grand palaces, historic forts &\r\ntimeless heritage on a luxurious 4N/5D tour. Experience elegance, culture & unforgettable mome', '', NULL, 'INDEX,FOLLOW', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"question\":\"1. What destinations are covered in the Rajasthan Heritage Tour 4N\\/5D?\",\"answer\":\"This tour typically includes iconic cities like Jaipur, Udaipur, and Jodhpur. Travelers explore\\nroyal palaces, forts, local markets, and cultural attractions showcasing Rajasthan\\u2019s rich\\nheritage.\"},{\"question\":\"2. What are the main highlights of this Rajasthan tour?\",\"answer\":\"The tour features top attractions such as Amber Fort, City Palace, and Mehrangarh Fort.\\nGuests also enjoy heritage walks, traditional cuisine, and vibrant cultural experiences.\"},{\"question\":\"3. Is accommodation included in the Rajasthan Heritage Tour package?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, the package by India Day Trip includes comfortable hotel stays, daily breakfast, and\\noptional heritage hotel upgrades for a royal experience.\"},{\"question\":\"4. What is the best time to book a Rajasthan Heritage Tour?\",\"answer\":\"The ideal time to visit Rajasthan is from October to March when the weather is pleasant for\\nsightseeing, desert experiences, and cultural festivals.\"},{\"question\":\"5. Is this Rajasthan tour suitable for families and couples?\",\"answer\":\"Absolutely! This 4N\\/5D tour is perfect for families, couples, and solo travelers looking to\\nexplore Rajasthan\\u2019s royal heritage, culture, and architecture in a short duration.\"}]', 1, ''),
(57, 'Rajasthan City Tour 3N4D', 'rajasthan-city-tour-3n4d', '<p>This <a href=\"https://indiadaytrip.com/tour/rajasthan-city-tour-3n4d\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Rajasthan City Tour 3N4D</strong></a> Package will take you to the best places in Rajasthan, including Jaipur, Jodhpur, and Pushkar. With a well-planned itinerary, you can see royal palaces, old forts, and the spiritual beauty of <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pushkar\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Pushkar</a> Lake. This tour of Rajasthan is great for couples, families, and people who have never travelled before because it includes private transportation, guided tours, and comfortable places to stay. You can see a lot of different cultures, histories, and buildings in one trip. Book your Rajasthan City Tour 3N4D now to get the best deal and have a smooth trip.N4&nbsp;</p>', '[\"Explore Jaipur, Jodhpur & Pushkar with private tour\",\"3 Nights hotel stay with daily breakfast included\",\"Visit forts, palaces & vibrant local markets\",\"Private AC car with driver for full tour comfort\",\"Guided sightseeing with local expert in each city\",\"Pickup & drop with hassle-free travel experience\"]', '[\"3 Nights Heritage Stay with daily breakfast\",\"Private AC vehicle with driver for entire tour\",\"Pickup & drop from hotel\\/airport\\/railway station\",\"Sightseeing in Jaipur, Jodhpur & Pushkar\",\"Professional local tour guide\",\"All tolls, parking, fuel & driver allowances\",\"Bottled water during travel\"]', '[\"5 % GST\",\"Monuments Entrance Fees\",\"Lunch & Dinner\",\"Tips\"]', '[{\"title\":\"Day 1: Jaipur to Pushkar (Approx. 150 km \\/ 3 hrs)\",\"points\":[\"Take a private drive to Pushkar to start your Rajasthan City Tour in Jaipur. When you get there, go to the famous Brahma Temple and the holy Pushkar Lake. Take a leisurely walk through the colorful bazaars and soak up the peaceful spiritual atmosphere. Get to your hotel and take some time to relax. This day is a great way to start your 3 Nights 4 Days Rajasthan tour package because it lets you relax and learn about the culture at the same time.\"]},{\"title\":\"Day 2: Pushkar to Jodhpur (Approx. 190 km \\/ 4 hrs)\",\"points\":[\"After breakfast, take a beautiful drive to Jodhpur, which is also known as the Blue City. When you reach, check in your hotel and take some time to relax. Later, visit the local markets, which are famous for their textiles and handicrafts. Enjoy the lively atmosphere and the way of life that has been passed down through generations in Rajasthan. This part of your trip adds to your Rajasthan city tour by letting you experience the culture and meet locals.\"]},{\"title\":\"Day 3: Jodhpur Sightseeing Tour\",\"points\":[\"Today is all about finding out what makes Jodhpur special. Visit the stunning Mehrangarh Fort for stunning views of the city, after fort stops at Jaswant Thada and Umaid Bhawan Palace in Jodhpur. Walk around the old blue streets and take pictures of special moments. This day of sightseeing is great for history lovers and photographers. It will give you a lot of information about Rajasthan\'s royal history during your 3N\\/4D Rajasthan tour\"]},{\"title\":\"Day 4: Jodhpur to Jaipur Drop (Approx. 330 km \\/ 6 hrs)\",\"points\":[\"After breakfast, take a private transfer back to Jaipur. Along the way, enjoy the changing scenery of Rajasthan. When you arrive, you will be taken to the place you chose, whether it is a hotel, airport, or train station. Your Rajasthan City Tour lasts for three nights and four days and ends with memories of culture, history, and travel that you will never forget.\"]}]', 18499.00, '[\"tours-image\\/1777451283_69f1c1132026c.png\",\"data:image\\/webp;base64,\\/V+WAD9\\/j+qBXb9ev9JfGT\\/w\\/+P\\/jZ\\/uX9m3AHGAe\\/\\/dtzGA\\/gDCAv4ANdBElNJ3kOmCPIkppO8h0wR5ElNJ3kOl4OC\\/MEpEgfDOTN1qMpcKRIHwzkzdajKXCkSB8M5M3WoylwpEgfDOTN1qMpcKRIHwzkzdajKXCkSB8cgD5mRnlGA\\/Srjs+9S8sJyDdbCHd4wjqkuxV0B\\\\/jBFJlLhSJA+Gcmbr