(58, 'Delhi Private Day Tour by Car', 'delhi-private-day-tour-by-car', '<p>Experience India\'s vibrant capital with a <a href=\"https://indiadaytrip.com/tour/delhi-private-day-tour-by-car\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Delhi Private Day Tour by Car</strong></a>, an ideal way to discover its history, culture and iconic landmarks all in a day! Relax comfortably as your</p><p>professional Guide provides expert commentary while visiting iconic attractions such as Red Fort, Jama Masjid India Gate Humayun\'s Tomb Qutub Minar Lotus Temple etc - ideal for</p><p>travelers limited on time but looking forward to memorable sightseeing experience in both Old &amp; New <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Delhi\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Delhi</a> at your own pace and convenience - perfect! Ideal for visitors with</p><p>limited travel plans this trip ensures smooth, convenient sightseeing experience that leaves lasting impressions!</p>', '[\"Explore Old & New Delhi with a comfortable private AC car\",\"Visits iconic Delhi landmarks like India Gate, Qutub Minar, and Lotus Temple.\",\"Explore the historic charm of Red Fort and Jama Masjid in Old Delhi\",\"Enjoy a personalized tour with flexible sightseeing at your pace & Comfort.\",\"Travel with a professional driver and expert local tour guide.\",\"Perfect one-day Delhi sightseeing tour for first-time visitors\"]', '[\"Private air-conditioned car for full-day Delhi sightseeing\",\"Professional Local Tour Guide\",\"Hotel \\/ Airport pickup and drop-off in Delhi NCR\",\"Fuel charges, toll tax, parking, and driver allowance\",\"Bottled drinking water during the tour\",\"Professional tour guide\"]', '[\"Monument entrance fees\",\"Meals and personal expenses\",\"Tips \\/ gratuities for driver and guide\"]', '[{\"title\":\"08:00 AM \\u2013 Hotel \\/ Airport Pickup\",\"points\":[\"Your private Tour driver will collect you from either your hotel or the airport in Delhi for an unforgettable Delhi sightseeing tour through India\'s vibrant capital. Travel in comfort through India in an air-conditioned car!\"]},{\"title\":\"09:00 AM \\u2013 Visit Jama Masjid\",\"points\":[\"Begin your Old Delhi exploration at one of India\'s largest mosques built by Emperor Shah Jahan: Jama Masjid. Climb its minaret for breathtaking views over Old Delhi\'s vibrant streets!\"]},{\"title\":\"10:00 AM: Rickshaw Ride in Chandni Chowk\",\"points\":[\"Take an authentic Indian rickshaw ride through the narrow lanes of Chandni Chowk market to experience its lively atmosphere, local shops and street food culture of historic Old Delhi.\"]},{\"title\":\"11:30 AM - Red Fort (Photo Stop)\",\"points\":[\"Visit this UNESCO World Heritage Site, symbol of Mughal power and take pictures while learning its history and significance. Pause here for photo opps.\"]},{\"title\":\"01:00 PM \\u2013 Lunch Break\",\"points\":[\"Take an extended lunch break at one of the local restaurants where you can try traditional North Indian cuisine.\"]},{\"title\":\"02:00 PM \\u2013 Humayun\\u2019s Tomb\",\"points\":[\"Visit Humayun\'s Tomb, an international landmark and masterpiece of Mughal architecture which inspired the design of Taj Mahal.\"]},{\"title\":\"03:30 PM \\u2013 Qutub Minar\",\"points\":[\"Explore Qutub Minar complex, home to one of the tallest brick minarets worldwide and a UNESCO World Heritage site.\"]},{\"title\":\"04:30 PM \\u2013 Lotus Temple\",\"points\":[\"Visit the iconic Lotus Temple for its remarkable architecture that mimics flowers and its peaceful meditation hall, open to people of all faiths and denominations.\"]},{\"title\":\"05:30 PM \\u2013 India Gate & President House Drive\",\"points\":[\"Take the India Gate & President House Drive through New Delhi\'s famous war memorial honoring Indian soldiers while experiencing breathtaking views of President\'s House and Parliament Houses in New Delhi.\"]},{\"title\":\"06:30 PM \\u2013 Drop-off at Hotel \\/ Airport\",\"points\":[\"Drop Off at Hotel\\/Airport After an incredible day exploring Delhi\'s top sights, your driver will drop you back off either at your hotel or the airport.\"]}]', 3999.00, '[\"1777368558_69f07dee80ba9.webp\",\"1777450580_69f1be54d5939.webp\",\"1777450647_69f1be9752beb.webp\",\"1777450669_69f1bead8297f.webp\",\"1777450669_69f1bead82ba6.webp\",\"1777450669_69f1bead82d73.webp\",\"1777450669_69f1bead83157.webp\",\"1777450669_69f1bead8328a.webp\",\"1777450669_69f1bead833b0.webp\",\"1777450669_69f1bead834d6.webp\"]', NULL, 20, 1, 'Delhi', '1 Days', 5.00, 54, '2026-01-07 18:10:27', '2026-04-30 02:25:04', 'Delhi Private Day Tour by Car | Full Day Sightseeing with G', 'See Delhi’s top sights in one day with a private car & expert guide. Old Delhi, New Delhi highlights, hotel pickup & smooth travel. Book today!', '', NULL, 'INDEX,FOLLOW', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"id\":\"0\",\"type\":\"custom\",\"data\":{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"TouristAttraction\",\"name\":\"Tour Name\",\"description\":\"Tour description\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"addressLocality\":\"Location\",\"addressRegion\":\"Uttar Pradesh\",\"addressCountry\":\"IN\"}}},{\"id\":\"1\",\"type\":\"custom\",\"data\":{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"TouristAttraction\",\"name\":\"Tour Name\",\"description\":\"Tour description\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"addressLocality\":\"Location\",\"addressRegion\":\"Uttar Pradesh\",\"addressCountry\":\"IN\"}}},{\"id\":\"2\",\"type\":\"custom\",\"data\":{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"TouristAttraction\",\"name\":\"Tour Name\",\"description\":\"Tour description\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"addressLocality\":\"Location\",\"addressRegion\":\"Uttar Pradesh\",\"addressCountry\":\"IN\"}}},{\"id\":\"3\",\"type\":\"custom\",\"data\":{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"TouristAttraction\",\"name\":\"Tour Name\",\"description\":\"Tour description\",\"address\":{\"@type\"