\":\"TouristAttraction\",\"name\":\"Tour Name\",\"description\":\"Tour description\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"addressLocality\":\"Location\",\"addressRegion\":\"Uttar Pradesh\",\"addressCountry\":\"IN\"}}},{\"id\":\"11\",\"type\":\"custom\",\"data\":{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"TouristAttraction\",\"name\":\"Tour Name\",\"description\":\"Tour description\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"addressLocality\":\"Location\",\"addressRegion\":\"Uttar Pradesh\",\"addressCountry\":\"IN\"}}},{\"id\":\"12\",\"type\":\"custom\",\"data\":{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"TouristAttraction\",\"name\":\"Tour Name\",\"description\":\"Tour description\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"addressLocality\":\"Location\",\"addressRegion\":\"Uttar Pradesh\",\"addressCountry\":\"IN\"}}},{\"id\":\"13\",\"type\":\"custom\",\"data\":{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"TouristAttraction\",\"name\":\"Tour Name\",\"description\":\"Tour description\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"addressLocality\":\"Location\",\"addressRegion\":\"Uttar Pradesh\",\"addressCountry\":\"IN\"}}},{\"id\":\"14\",\"type\":\"custom\",\"data\":{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"TouristAttraction\",\"name\":\"Tour Name\",\"description\":\"Tour description\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"addressLocality\":\"Location\",\"addressRegion\":\"Uttar Pradesh\",\"addressCountry\":\"IN\"}}},{\"id\":\"15\",\"type\":\"custom\",\"data\":{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"TouristAttraction\",\"name\":\"Tour Name\",\"description\":\"Tour description\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"addressLocality\":\"Location\",\"addressRegion\":\"Uttar Pradesh\",\"addressCountry\":\"IN\"}}}]'),
(59, 'Evening Delhi City Tour 4 Hours', 'evening-delhi-city-tour-4-hours', '<p><strong>Delhi Street Food Tour</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\">This memorable </span><a href=\"https://indiadaytrip.com/tour/evening-delhi-city-tour-4-hours\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: rgb(17, 85, 204); background-color: transparent;\"><strong>Evening Delhi City Tour 4 Hours</strong></a><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"> is ideal for travelers with limited time who wish to discover Delhi highlights and Local Street in an informative yet entertaining fashion. Visit iconic sites such as India Gate, </span><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chandni_Chowk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\">Chandni Chowk</a><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"> Rashtrapati Bhavan Parliament House as the sun sets and witness beautiful city transformation as stunning views unfold and great photo opps become available - travel comfortably by private car with professional guide ensuring this </span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\">Evening Delhi City Tour 4 Hours</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"> offers unparalleled insight into its beauty, history and local atmosphere!</span></p>', '[\"Explore illuminated India Gate in the evening light\",\"drive past Rashtrapati Bhavan and Parliament House that have been beautifully lit up, \",\"walk through lively Connaught Place to experience Delhi\'s nightlife vibe\",\"Tatse delicious street foods such as chaat, golgappa or local snacks - you won\'t be  disappointed!\",\"Enjoy a comfortable private AC car Pickup & Drop service from your hotel\"]', '[\"Private air-conditioned car for a comfortable 4-hour city tour\",\"Hotel pickup and drop-off in Delhi\",\"Professional English-speaking driver\\/guide\",\"Bottled mineral water during the tour\",\"Street food tasting experience at a popular local market\",\"All fuel charges, parking fees, and taxes\"]', '[\"Monument entrance fees (if any)\",\"Personal expenses such as shopping or extra food\",\"Tips and gratuities for driver or guide\"]', '[{\"title\":\"04:30 PM - Hotel Pickup & Start a Tour \",\"points\":[\"Your driver will pick you up at your hotel \\/ other Location  in Delhi in an priavte AC car  for an enjoyable evening Delhi City Tour \"]},{\"title\":\"05:00 PM \\u2013 Visit India Gate \",\"points\":[\"Arrive at India Gate for a relaxing walk around this iconic war memorial landmarks  and experience its captivating lights in the evening atmosphere. \"]},{\"title\":\"05:45 PM \\u2013 Drive Past Rashtrapati Bhavan & Parliament House\",\"points\":[\"Drive past Rashtrapati Bhavan & Parliament House for some stunning sights to be  seen Have a scenic drive through New Delhi\'s VIP areas, seeing Rashtrapati Bhavan  and Parliament House illuminated in the evening light show.  \"]},{\"title\":\"06:30 PM \\u2013 Connaught Place Market Visit & Food Tasting\",\"points\":[\"Explore the bustling Connaught Place market. Taste delicious street foods such as  chaat or golgappa while taking in local culture. \"]},{\"title\":\"07:45 PM \\u2013 Return Drive to Hotel\",\"points\":[\"After an enjoyable evening experience, relax during your return drive back to your  hotel at 08:30 PM with Hotel Drop Off Service provided for  \"]},{\"title\":\"08:30 PM \\u2013 Hotel Drop-off\",\"points\":[\"Your driver will take you back to your hotel at the conclusion of this 4-hour Delhi  evening tour, marking an end to this unforgettable adventure. \"]}]', 25999.00, '[\"1777449013_69f1b835a16af.webp\",\"1777449029_69f1b84512b02.webp\",\"1777449046_69f1b856c5f56.webp\",\"1777449068_69f1b86c03e87.webp\",\"1777449068_69f1b86c04149.webp\",\"1777449068_69f1b86c0436a.webp\"]', NULL, 20, 1, 'Delhi', '4 Hours', 5.00, 272, '2026-01-07 18:12:00', '2026-04-29 20:23:40', 'Evening Delhi City Tour 4 Hours with Pickup & Drop & Guide', 'Enjoy a 4-hour evening Delhi tour with street food tasting. Visit India Gate & Connaught Place with pickup, drop & guide. Taste local flavors—book now!', '', NULL, 'INDEX,FOLLOW', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"question\":\"1. What places are covered in the Evening Delhi City Tour?\",\"answer\":\"This tour typically includes major attractions like India Gate, Rashtrapati Bhavan, Gurudwara\\nBangla Sahib, and Connaught Place, beautifully illuminated in the evening\"},{\"question\":\"2. Is hotel pickup and drop included in the tour?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, the tour includes comfortable pickup and drop from your hotel or preferred location\\nanywhere in Delhi, ensuring a hassle-free experience.\"},{\"question\":\"3. Will a professional guide be provided?\",\"answer\":\"Absolutely! A knowledgeable local guide will accompany you, sharing interesting history and\\nstories about Delhi\\u2019s landmarks during the tour.\"},{\"question\":\"4. What is the duration of the evening city tour?\",\"answer\":\"The tour lasts approximately 4 hours, giving you enough time to explore Delhi\\u2019s iconic sights\\nand enjoy the city\\u2019s vibrant evening atmosphere.\"},{\"question\":\"5. Is this tour suitable for first-time visitors to Delhi?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, this tour is perfect for first-time visitors who want a quick yet memorable introduction to\\nDelhi\\u2019s top attractions in a short time.\"}]', 1, '');

